word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113559"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4p9ylm/"></a><strong>3</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 19%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113560"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxffgcd/"></a><strong>010</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 66.28%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113561/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113561" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113561"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw8iha7/"></a>Основные средства, сданные по договору финансовой аренды</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 13.66%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113562/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113562" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113562"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqizq2y/"></a><strong>3</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 19%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113563/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113563" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113563"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnryr9x/"></a><strong>011</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 66.28%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113564/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113564" data-dwh-sourc