/"></a>Поступление основных средств от обособленных подразделений, дочерних и зависимых хозяйственных обществ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113670/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113670" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113670"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgigmig/"></a>0110-0190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113671/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113671" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113671"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashmg8g9/"></a>6110, 6120</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113672/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113672" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113672"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrcz19u/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113673/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113673" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113673"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1o40ub/"></a>Увеличение первоначальной стоимости основных средств в результате достройки, дооборудования, модернизации, реконструкции и других качественных улучшений</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113674/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113674" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113674"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasggmu6s/"></a>0110-0190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anc