rap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113762/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113762" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113762"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasilgxg5/"></a>0211-0299</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113763/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113763" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113763"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszskfb1/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113764/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113764" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113764"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas36upr6/"></a>Начисление износа по основным средствам, эксплуатируемым на:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113765/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113765" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113765"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashpbkht/"></a>а) пусконаладочных работах, предназначенных для производства новых видов изделий;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113766/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113766" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113766"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspggy8d/"></a>б) обслуживании при освоении новых технологических процессов, не предназначенных для серийного или массового производства</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113767/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113767" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113767"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5b6hqu/"></a>9430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113768/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113768" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113768"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqe17cf/"></a>0211-0299</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113769/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113769" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113769"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxt31zw/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113770/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113770" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113770"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas89k0kx/"></a>Начисление износа по рабочему скоту</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113771/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113771" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113771"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfase31qrf/"></a>счета учета затрат</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113772/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113772" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113772"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9fhzw5/"></a>0270</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113773/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113773" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113773"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmrqrib/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113774/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113774" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113774"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbwa7x4/"></a>Начисление износа многолетних насаждений</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113775/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113775" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113775"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas98snv2/"></a>счета учета затрат</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113776/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113776" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113776"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx1ygf4/"></a>0280</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113777/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113777" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113777"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasp59m09/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113778/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113778" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr113778"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasdixyv0/"></a>Начисление износа основных средств, переданных в оперативную аренду</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr113779/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="113779" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-ph