rase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114552" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114552"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvn77dg/"></a>Списание суммы претензий, которые не подлежат взысканию</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114553/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114553" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114553"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd7ibn9/"></a>1110, 1120</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114554/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114554" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114554"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvrfip7/"></a>4860</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114555/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114555" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114555"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9vfpad/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114556/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114556" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114556"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskzn086/"></a>Затраты подотчетных лиц по доставке животных</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114557/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114557" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114557"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6lo42r/"></a>1110, 1120</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114558/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114558" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114558"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5hlpd4/"></a>6970</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114559"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaseduutr/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114560"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasncq58v/"></a>Оприходование молодняка животных, полученного от учредителей в качестве вклада</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114561/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114561" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114561"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasscgl84/"></a>1110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114562/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114562" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114562"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrykeqn/"></a>4610</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114563/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114563" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114563"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswui8to/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" styl