style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114791/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114791" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114791"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9b8457/"></a>24.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114792/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114792" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114792"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfvwfqr/"></a>Переоценка незавершенной продукции:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114793/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114793" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114793"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassna2uw/"></a>а) дооценка;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114794/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114794" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114794"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasakfpm3/"></a>б) уценка</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114795/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114795" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114795"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswxx8pn/"></a>2010</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114796/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114796" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114796"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas92qxpa/"></a>3290</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114797/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114797" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114797"></a><a data-anch