r="/document/90/15200/dfaspbww7c/"></a>26.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114804/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114804" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114804"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasb7l1dp/"></a>Списание потерь от неисправимого брака продукции, выявленных в основном производстве</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114805/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114805" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114805"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw1k45s/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114806/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114806" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114806"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas75z4lk/"></a>2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114807/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114807" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114807"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqiwypm/"></a>27.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114808/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114808" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114808"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxa45if/"></a>Выпуск продукции по фактической себестоимости</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114809/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114809" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114809"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasz0y3fp/"></a>2810</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114810/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114810" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114810"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspd1pvh/"></a>2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114811/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114811" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114811"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashrc9bo/"></a>28.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114812/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114812" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114812"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbps8xk/"></a>Реализация выполненных работ или оказанных услуг основных цехов; списание суммы затрат по законченным и принятым заказчиком этапам работ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114813/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114813" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114813"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd69mcm/"></a>9130</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114814/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114814" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114814"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskeokek/"></a>2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114815/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114815" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114815"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2iv9pp/"></a>29.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114816/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114816" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114816"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3axqhc/"></a>Списание себестоимости продукции при прочем выбытии (безвозмездная передача и др.)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114817/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114817" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114817"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2gqp9s/"></a>9110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114818/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114818" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114818"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskkw5d9/"></a>2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114819/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114819" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114819"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvgkzr9/"></a>30.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114820/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114820" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114820"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasinl3rr/"></a>Списание потерь незавершенного производства в результате стихийных бедствий, пожара и т.п.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114821/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114821" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114821"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd6bfdz/"></a>9720</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114822/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114822" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114822"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaso46syr/"></a>2010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114823/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114823" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114823"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmw5asb/"></a>31.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114824/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114824" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114824"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascg4g1f/"></a>Выявление недостачи материальных ценностей в основном производстве</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114825/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114825" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114825"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassqy99g/"></a>5910</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114826/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114826" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114826"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas83cloh/"></a>2010</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114827/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114827" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114827"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw11vgm/"></a><strong>Полуфабрикаты собственного производства (2100)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114828/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114828" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114828"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5ggpc3/"></a>121. На счете 2110 &#34;Полуфабрикаты собственного производства&#34; могут отражаться полуфабрикаты собственного производства (при полном производственном цикле), такие как:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114829/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114829" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114829"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgg3erb/"></a>чугун передельный в черной металлургии, сырая резина и клей в резинотехнической промышленности, серная кислота на азотно-туковых комбинатах химической промышленности, пряжа и суровье в текстильной промышленности и другие.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114830/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114830" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114830"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastaptbv/"></a>По дебету счета 2110 &#34;Полуфабрикаты собственного производства&#34; в корреспонденции со счетом 2010 &#34;Основное производство&#34; отражаются расходы, связанные с изготовлением полуфабрикатов. По кредиту счета 2110 &#34;Полуфабрикаты собственного производства&#34; отражается себестоимость полуфабрикатов, переданных в дальнейшую переработку, в корреспонденции со счетом 2010 &#34;Основное производство&#34; и себестоимость реализованных полуфабрикатов в корреспонденции со счетом 9110 &#34;Себестоимость реализованной готовой продукции&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114831/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114831" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114831"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastqapbu/"></a>Аналитический учет по счету 2110 &#34;Полуфабрикаты собственного производства&#34; ведется по местам хранения полуфабрикатов и отдельным наименованиям (видам, сортам, размерам и т.п.).</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114832/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114832" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114832"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasse90ep/"></a>122. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета полуфабрикатов собственного производства (2100) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114833/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114833" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114833"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2y7i9g/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114834/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114834" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114834"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasypgg8x/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114835/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114835" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114835"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskqcgsc/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114836/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114836" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114836"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasedxecm/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114837/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114837" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114837"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5r4rfe/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114838/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114838" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114838"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasp4v82o/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114839/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114839" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114839"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas25vgyl/"></a>Оприходование на склад полуфабрикатов, выпущенных основным и вспомогательным производством</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114840/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114840" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114840"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasszedcy/"></a>2110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114841/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114841" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114841"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvhmr1a/"></a>2010, 2310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114842/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114842" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114842"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas80nsoh/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114843/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114843" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114843"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslzd2za/"></a>Оприходование излишков полуфабрикатов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114844/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114844" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114844"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassbrztw/"></a>2110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114845/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114845" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114845"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw4ic71/"></a>9390</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr114846/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="114846" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr114846"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7wp6hx/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap