 подразделениям</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115065/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115065" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115065"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasre1m30/"></a>4110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115066/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115066" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115066"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9eer1t/"></a>2310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115067/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115067" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115067"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx90cgr/"></a>37.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115068/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115068" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115068"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvup186/"></a>Списание потерь вспомогательных цехов из-за стихийных бедствий, пожара и т.п.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115069/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115069" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115069"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnxvbzn/"></a>9720</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115070/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115070" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115070"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash69ame/"></a>2310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115071/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115071" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115071"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqa02s3/"></a>38.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115072/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115072" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115072"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd6xzgf/"></a>Выявленные недостачи и порча материальных ценностей во вспомогательных производствах</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115073/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115073" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115073"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6hem78/"></a>5910</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115074/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115074" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115074"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasasxq7p/"></a>2310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115075/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115075" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115075"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasly8vo0/"></a>39.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115076/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115076" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115076"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspmq7fw/"></a>Расходы и потери по возвратной и многооборотной таре</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115077/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115077" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115077"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszc3c5g/"></a>9430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115078/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115078" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115078"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx2id2w/"></a>2310</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115079/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115079" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115079"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbet5us/"></a><strong>Общепроизводственные расходы (2500)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115080/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115080" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115080"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastt0isz/"></a>127. Обобщение информации об общепроизводственных расходах осуществляется на счете 2510 &#34;Общепроизводственные расходы&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115081/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115081" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115081"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasi5iwtb/"></a>128. На этом счете отражаются расходы общепроизводственного характера, в том числе:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115082/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115082" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115082"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas614ywc/"></a>а) по содержанию и эксплуатации машин и оборудования;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115083/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115083" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115083"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasf3hthb/"></a>б) амортизационные отчисления основных средств и нематериальных активов производственного назначения;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115084/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115084" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115084"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvyz83a/"></a>в) затраты на ремонт основных средств производственного назначения;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115085/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115085" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115085"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd47k2w/"></a>г) расходы по страхованию производственного имущества;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115086/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115086" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115086"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfast5lyfl/"></a>д) расходы на отопление, освещение и содержание производственных помещений;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115087/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115087" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115087"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9zoi5a/"></a>е) арендная плата за производственные помещения, машины и оборудование, другие арендуемые средства, используемые в производстве;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115088/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115088" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115088"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas12bkgu/"></a>ж) оплата труда производственного персонала, занятого обслуживанием производства;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115089/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115089" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115089"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnq19yu/"></a>з) другие расходы производственного характера.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115090/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115090" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115090"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4sxy36/"></a>129. Общепроизводственные расходы отражаются по дебету счета учета общепроизводственных расходов, в корреспонденции со счетами учета производственных запасов, расчетов с персоналом по оплате труда и др. Расходы, учтенные на счете учета общепроизводственных расходов, списываются в дебет счетов 2010 &#34;Основное производство&#34;, 2310 &#34;Вспомогательное производство&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115091/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115091" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115091"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasm66ilr/"></a>Порядок распределения общепроизводственных расходов между отдельными объектами учета определяется в учетной политике организации.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115092/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115092" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115092"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5bubb0/"></a>Аналитический учет по счету учета общепроизводственных расходов ведется по отдельным подразделениям организации и статьям расходов.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115093/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115093" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115093"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswoq4hf/"></a>130. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета общепроизводственных расходов (2500) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115094/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115094" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115094"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1zirze/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115095/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115095" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115095"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascmgar5/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115096/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115096" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115096"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasc54shs/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115097/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115097" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115097"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0ad3i1/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115098/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115098" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115098"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasio6z66/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115099/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115099" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115099"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasb4ndto/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115100/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115100" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115100"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas232vqs/"></a>Износ основных средств общепроизводственного назначения</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115101/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115101" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115101"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashc1t6f/"></a>2510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115102/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115102" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115102"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskqrplx/"></a>0220-0299</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115103/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115103" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115103"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasf6hkku/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115104/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115104" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115104"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg8n98d/"></a>Амортизация нематериальных активов общепроизводственного назначения</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115105/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115105" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115105"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9ygul8/"></a>2510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115106/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115106" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115106"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrt8y91/"></a>0510-0590</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115107/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115107" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115107"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas02ayea/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115108/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115108" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115108"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasei6q4w/"></a>Расходование материалов на общепроизводственные цели</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115109/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115109" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115109"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasp2zx96/"></a>2510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115110/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115110" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115110"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskohzm3/"></a>1010-1090</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115111/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115111" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115111"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5igzut/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115112/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115112" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115112"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasr2sdik/"></a>Списание отклонений в стоимости материалов, израсходованных на общепроизводственные цели</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115113/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115113" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115113"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaso7eaun/"></a>2510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115114/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115114" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115114"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6dpr39/"></a>1610</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115115/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115115" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115115"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgtb6cb/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115116/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115116" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115116"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascd0nok/"></a>Отпуск полуфабрикатов собственного производства для общепроизводственных целей (проведение испытаний, опытов)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115117/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115117" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115117"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasggxt6o/"></a>2510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115118/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115118" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115118"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmn63mw/"></a>2110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115119/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115119" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115119"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8me0ra/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115120/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115120" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115120"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7ipyxp/"></a>Списание услуг вспомогательных производств на общепроизводственные расходы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115121/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115121" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bss