ata-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas53xd9b/"></a>18.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115168/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115168" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115168"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgxo0pn/"></a>Включение части общепроизводственных расходов в сумму расходов по исправлению брака</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115169/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115169" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115169"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuwp2hq/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115170/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115170" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115170"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskekz4w/"></a>2510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115171/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115171" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115171"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmhd9b2/"></a>19.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115172/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115172" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115172"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasho39xr/"></a>Отражение расходов по обслуживанию производства в составе расходов будущих периодов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115173/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115173" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115173"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0nqp4t/"></a>3110-3190</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115174/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115174" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115174"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslcfezf/"></a>2510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115175/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115175" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115175"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasegeywe/"></a>20.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115176/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115176" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115176"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd7gr5e/"></a>Отнесение части общепроизводственных расходов (простои и пр.) на ответственных лиц</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115177/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115177" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115177"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasugng0g/"></a>4730</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115178/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115178" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115178"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasecer7u/"></a>2510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115179/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115179" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115179"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasu4tnwd/"></a>21.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115180/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115180" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115180"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas95yw7p/"></a>Списание части общепроизводственных расходов (в результате стихийных бедствий, пожара и др.) на убытки</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115181/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115181" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115181"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasf40za1/"></a>9430, 9720</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115182/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115182" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115182"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0ggsx4/"></a>2510</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115183/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115183" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115183"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslgr014/"></a><strong>Брак в производстве (2600)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115184/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115184" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115184"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas76a4n9/"></a>131. Обобщение информации о потерях от брака в производстве осуществляется на счете 2610 &#34;Брак в производстве&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115185/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115185" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115185"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmh6d6e/"></a>По дебету счета 2610 &#34;Брак в производстве&#34; собираются затраты по выявленному браку, а также затраты на гарантийный ремонт.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115186/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115186" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115186"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskygfb0/"></a>По кредиту счета 2600 &#34;Брак в производстве&#34; отражаются суммы, относимые на уменьшение потерь от брака (стоимость забракованной продукции по цене возможного использования, суммы, подлежащие удержанию с виновников брака, суммы, подлежащие взысканию с поставщиков за поставку недоброкачественных материалов и полуфабрикатов, в результате использования которых был допущен брак и т.п.), а также суммы, списываемые на затраты производства как потери от брака.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115187/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115187" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115187"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgxentn/"></a>Аналитический учет по счетам учета брака в производстве ведется по отдельным цехам организации, видам продукции, статьям расходов и причинам брака.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115188/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115188" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115188"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassn6ung/"></a>132. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета брака в производстве (2600), с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115189/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115189" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115189"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswxtgc9/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115190/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115190" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115190"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbw77yk/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115191/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115191" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115191"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6c8sgd/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115192/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115192" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115192"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasdenr7o/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115193/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115193" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115193"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx6smkq/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115194/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115194" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115194"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashgmvyh/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115195/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115195" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115195"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswii24c/"></a>Расходование материалов на исправление брака</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115196/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115196" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115196"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuhuphh/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115197/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115197" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115197"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasypd1wl/"></a>1010-1090</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115198/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115198" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115198"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfb0br8/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115199/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115199" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115199"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfass9zz62/"></a>Списание потерь от неисправимого брака, выявленного в основном и вспомогательном производстве</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115200/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115200" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115200"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasszbxwd/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115201/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115201" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115201"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9g0bef/"></a>2010, 2310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115202/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115202" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115202"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskralb9/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115203/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115203" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115203"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfyvugz/"></a>Выявление и списание забракованных полуфабрикатов собственного производства</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115204/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115204" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115204"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5wsxyo/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115205/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115205" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115205"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxbnxa3/"></a>2110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115206/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115206" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115206"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszho9wv/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115207/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115207" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115207"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxg0tbv/"></a>Включение доли общепроизводственных расходов в себестоимость брака</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115208/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115208" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115208"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas88w5z0/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115209/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115209" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115209"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9o40i4/"></a>2510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115210/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115210" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115210"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0r65y4/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115211/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115211" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115211"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0yyug9/"></a>Себестоимость продукции, отправленной покупателю взамен забракованной</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115212/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115212" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115212"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8gzge0/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115213/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115213" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115213"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasc7zt29/"></a>2810</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115214/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115214" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115214"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmcwuab/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115215/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115215" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115215"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasi6md3d/"></a>Полученные услуги при исправлении брака и гарантийному ремонту от поставщиков</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115216/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115216" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115216"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg5ulk7/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115217/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115217" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115217"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7yg4bg/"></a>6010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115218/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115218" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115218"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgfogad/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115219/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115219" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115219"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas31zq6t/"></a>Расходы по единому социальному платежу, относящиеся к браку в производстве</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115220/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115220" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115220"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskoxpoi/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115221/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115221" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115221"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg7h9c6/"></a>6520</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115222/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115222" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115222"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmq1sv2/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115223/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115223" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115223"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas11135m/"></a>Начисление суммы оплаты труда по исправлению брака</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115224/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115224" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115224"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastas4sf/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115225/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115225" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115225"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasobmgyt/"></a>6710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115226/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115226" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115226"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasid0ren/"></a>9.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115227/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115227" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115227"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastrkxnb/"></a>Списание с подотчетных лиц сумм, связанных с возвратом бракованной продукции и др.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115228/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115228" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115228"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassee4fm/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115229/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115229" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115229"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasz36l4c/"></a>4220-4290</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115230/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115230" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115230"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfast8tip7/"></a>6970</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115231/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115231" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115231"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasord0i3/"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115232/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115232" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115232"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspfxegl/"></a>Задолженность перед потребителями за произведенные ими расходы по исправлению полученной бракованной продукции</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115233/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115233" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115233"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvco1a2/"></a>2610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115234/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115234" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115234"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbfs099/"></a>6990</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115235/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115235" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115235"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9v8u3k/"></a>11.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115236/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115236" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115236"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4m0o91/"></a>Оприходование материальных ценностей (по цене возможного использования), оставшихся от исправления брака и списания окончательного брака</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115237/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115237" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115237"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvsu7qf/"></a>1010-1090</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115238/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115238" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115238"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqt8cdq/"></a>2610</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115239/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115239" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115239"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfask5xgng/"></a>12.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115240/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115240" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115240"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx9regt/"></a>Включение потерь от брака в себестоимость продукции, работ и услуг основного и вспомогательного производства</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115241/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115241" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115241"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswoqv9e/"></a>2010, 2310</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115242/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115242" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115242"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashyrr3w/"></a>2610</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115243/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115243" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115243"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfast8b4ep/"></a>13.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115244/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115244" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115244"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxn0a5f/"></a>Списание потерь от брака за счет рабочих, виновных в нанесении материального ущерба</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115245/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115245" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115245"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfask7insl/"></a>4730</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115246/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115246" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115246"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas82imcn/"></a>2610</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115247/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115247" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115247"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasahx7ep/"></a>14.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115248/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115248" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115248"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfask461gp/"></a>Списание некомпенсируемых потерь от брака прошлых лет на убытки</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115249/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115249" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115249"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9m9r5d/"></a>9430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115250/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115250" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115250"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmnxquf/"></a>2610</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115251/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115251" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115251"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxskvf8/"></a><strong>Обслуживающие хозяйства (2700)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115252/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115252" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115252"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspkzuwi/"></a>133. Обобщение информации о затратах, связанных с выпуском продукции, выполнением работ и оказанием услуг обслуживающими хозяйствами, осуществляется на счете 2710 &#34;Обслуживающие хозяйства&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115253/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115253" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115253"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslgavuo/"></a>Под обслуживающими хозяйствами организации понимаются производства и хозяйства, деятельность которых не связана с производством продукции, выполнением работ и оказанием услуг, являющихся основной деятельностью этой организации. В частности, на данном счете отражаются затраты на содержание объектов здравоохранения, детских садов, объектов жилищно-коммунального хозяйства, спорта и культуры, пошивочных и других мастерских бытового обслуживания, столовых и буфетов, научно-исследовательских и опытно-конструкторских обособленных подразделений, находящихся на балансе организации.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115254/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115254" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115254"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashvcksu/"></a>134. По дебету счета 2710 &#34;Обслуживающие хозяйства&#34; отражаются расходы, связанные с выпуском продукции, выполнением работ и оказанием услуг обслуживающих хозяйств. При этом расходы списываются в дебет счета 2710 &#34;Обслуживающие хозяйства&#34; с кредита счетов учета товарно-материальных запасов, расчетов с персоналом по оплате труда и других счетов.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115255/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115255" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115255"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg23xth/"></a>По кредиту счета 2710 &#34;Обслуживающие хозяйства&#34; отражается фактическая себестоимость выпущенной продукции, выполненных работ и оказанных услуг обслуживающих хозяйств. Эти суммы отражаются по кредиту счета 2710 &#34;Обслуживающие хозяйства&#34; в корреспонденции со счетами учета товарно-материальных запасов и другими счетами.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115256/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115256" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115256"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw38ssm/"></a>Сальдо по счету 2710 &#34;Обслуживающие хозяйства&#34; на конец месяца показывает стоимость незавершенного производства.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115257/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115257" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115257"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasszirfw/"></a>Аналитический учет по счету 2710 &#34;Обслуживающие хозяйства&#34; ведется по каждому обслуживающему хозяйству и по элементам, статьям затрат и по видам продукции.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115258/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115258" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115258"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswxd0xt/"></a>135. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета обслуживающих хозяйств (2700) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115259/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115259" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115259"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasn6cst9/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115260/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115260" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115260"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaso8wf6p/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115261/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115261" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115261"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasf0dmgu/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115262/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115262" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115262"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasefwz5i/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115263/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115263" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115263"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasif0t5x/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115264/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115264" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115264"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspqks36/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115265/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115265" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115265"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasla3fqb/"></a>Износ основных средств, используемых в обслуживающих хозяйствах</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115266/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115266" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115266"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasltbq7x/"></a>2710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115267/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115267" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115267"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmhlpd8/"></a>0210-0299</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115268/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115268" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115268"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasa2h329/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115269/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115269" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115269"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnqx9g0/"></a>Расходы на оплату труда работников, занятых в обслуживающих хозяйствах</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115270/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115270" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115270"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasotwy3l/"></a>2710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115271/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115271" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115271"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxmao31/"></a>6710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115272/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115272" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115272"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrfl182/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115273/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115273" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115273"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8g09w6/"></a>Амортизация нематериальных активов, используемых в обслуживающих хозяйствах</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115274/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115274" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115274"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasf2hmxa/"></a>2710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115275/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115275" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115275"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx9g4od/"></a>0510-0590</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115276/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115276" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115276"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbg0rgg/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115277/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115277" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115277"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3rzyqn/"></a>Стоимость потребленных услуг обслуживающими хозяйствами, оказанных вспомогательными производствами</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115278/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115278" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115278"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasdob3ah/"></a>2710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115279/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115279" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115279"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasidgra4/"></a>2310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115280/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115280" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115280"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspid4vg/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115281/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115281" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115281"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash6cu97/"></a>Распределение расходов обслуживающих хозяйств на расходы по реализации и административные расходы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115282/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115282" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115282"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgxn5dw/"></a>9410, 9420</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115283/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115283" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115283"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfast1emki/"></a>2710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115284/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115284" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115284"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmqg5g7/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115285/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115285" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115285"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6pgxg9/"></a>Списание убытков от обслуживающих хозяйств на расходы периода в конце отчетного периода</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115286/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115286" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115286"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9gofwu/"></a>9430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115287/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115287" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115287"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd6wty6/"></a>2710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115288/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115288" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115288"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasorlrsh/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115289/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115289" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115289"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2mycq2/"></a>Расходование материалов на нужды обслуживающих хозяйств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115290/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115290" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115290"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasm29bl8/"></a>2710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115291/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115291" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115291"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslxr73f/"></a>1010-1090</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115292/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115292" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115292"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas94qh3v/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115293/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115293" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115293"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas871vcv/"></a>Забой животных для получения продукции</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115294/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115294" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_ancho