th: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasyz2qry/"></a>2910-2990</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslcxwz9/"></a>14.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuhwe3b/"></a>Недостача, выявленная в результате инвентаризации по вине материально ответственного лица</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrtki7f/"></a>4730</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnnxxmg/"></a>2910-2990</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr115583/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="115583" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr115583"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/d