: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119392/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119392" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119392"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasurauqa/"></a>9210, 9220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119393/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119393" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119393"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw39112/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119394/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119394" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119394"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasef2f4h/"></a>Суммы, подлежащие взысканию с виновных лиц за недостачу ценных бумаг</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119395/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119395" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119395"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslgd2um/"></a>4730</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119396/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119396" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119396"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswynzwd/"></a>0610-0690, 5810-5830</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119397/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119397" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119397"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasggw5ye/"></a>9.</p></td><