 претензии по недостачам, ошибкам в счетах и по качеству (при использовании счета 1510)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119497/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119497" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119497"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0v1qym/"></a>4860</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119498/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119498" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119498"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfase6atav/"></a>1510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119499/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119499" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119499"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasneuz9v/"></a>12.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119500/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119500" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119500"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfass8k1l8/"></a>Предъявление претензии банку по суммам, ошибочно списанным со счетов организации</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119501/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119501" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119501"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasd8eie0/"></a>4860</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119502/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119502" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119502"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1husvp/"></a>5110-5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119503/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119503" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119503"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas38dfsz/"></a>13.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119504/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119504" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119504"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasanhnto/"></a>Предъявление претензий поставщикам при оприходовании поступивших материальных ценностей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119505/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119505" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119505"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastplhg8/"></a>4860</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119506/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119506" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119506"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3rhti3/"></a>6010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash44lnn/"></a>14.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9yd6os/"></a>Сумма штрафов, пени и неустоек, признанных другими организациями, за невыполнение договорных обязательств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119509/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119509" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119509"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5mz3rq/"></a>4860</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119510/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119510" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119510"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasisasqo/"></a>9330</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119511/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119511" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119511"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslid528/"></a>15.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119512/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119512" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119512"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnouoz3/"></a>Отнесение суммы неудовлетворенной претензии на счета учета затрат</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119513/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119513" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119513"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasempna5/"></a>Счета учета затрат</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119514/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119514" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119514"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascul9bi/"></a>4860</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119515/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119515" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119515"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9sc9gc/"></a>16.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119516/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119516" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119516"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmq9clz/"></a>Оказание услуг обособленными подразделениями различным организациям</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119517/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119517" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119517"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastxgr9f/"></a>4890</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119518/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119518" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119518"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasf2z6cu/"></a>6110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119519/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119519" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119519"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnrk4rq/"></a>17.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119520/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119520" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119520"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvp6730/"></a>Суммы, причитающиеся работникам за счет других организаций и лиц</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119521/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119521" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119521"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas77h4n2/"></a>4890</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119522/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119522" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119522"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas05mm7t/"></a>6710</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119523/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119523" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119523"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfast0ywhf/"></a><strong>Резерв по сомнительным долгам (4900)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119524/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119524" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119524"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas20feoz/"></a>217. Обобщение информации о состоянии и движении резервов по сомнительным долгам осуществляется на счете 4910 &#34;Резерв по сомнительным долгам&#34;. Резерв создается на сумму сомнительных долгов организации по расчетам с юридическими и физическими лицами и относится на счет 9430 &#34;Прочие операционные расходы&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119525/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119525" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119525"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9589k7/"></a>Сомнительным долгом признается дебиторская задолженность организации, которая не погашена в установленный срок и не обеспечена соответствующими гарантиями.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119526/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119526" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119526"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasai4nqy/"></a>Резерв по сомнительным долгам создается на основе результатов проведенной в конце отчетного года инвентаризации дебиторской задолженности организации.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119527/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119527" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119527"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6gmeg7/"></a>218. Величина резерва определяется отдельно по каждому сомнительному долгу в зависимости от финансового состояния (платежеспособности) должника и оценки вероятности погашения долга в полной или частичной сумме.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119528/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119528" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119528"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasig1ggk/"></a>Если до конца года, следующего за годом создания резерва по сомнительному долгу, этот резерв в какой-либо части не будет использован, неизрасходованная сумма присоединяется к прибыли соответствующего года.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119529/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119529" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119529"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqtcvqd/"></a>219. Списание с баланса долгов, ранее признанных организацией сомнительными, отражается по дебету счета 4910 &#34;Резерв по сомнительным долгам&#34; в корреспонденции с соответствующими счетами учета расчетов с дебиторами (счета к получению). Присоединение к прибыли неизрасходованных сумм резерва по сомнительным долгам отражается по дебету счета 4910 &#34;Резерв по сомнительным долгам&#34; и кредиту счета 9390 &#34;Прочие операционные доходы&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119530/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119530" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119530"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvid8px/"></a>220. Аналитический учет по счету 4910 &#34;Резерв по сомнительным долгам&#34; ведется по каждому сомнительному долгу и срокам, на который создан резерв.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119531/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119531" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119531"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastvxyra/"></a>221. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета резерва по сомнительным долгам (4900) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119532/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119532" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119532"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashi5qe9/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 62%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119533/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119533" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119533"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvc5vgr/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119534/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119534" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119534"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasm6t1da/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119535/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119535" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119535"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuomazt/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 16%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119536/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119536" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119536"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasdggqzf/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119537/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119537" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119537"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2i68gd/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 62%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119538/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119538" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119538"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasteg1lw/"></a>Создан резерв по сомнительным долгам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119539/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119539" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119539"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2pvsr7/"></a>9430</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 16%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119540/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119540" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119540"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxlof5k/"></a>4910</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119541/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119541" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119541"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas642gp6/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 62%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119542/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119542" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119542"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8v0krv/"></a>Списаны долги покупателей и заказчиков за счет резерва по сомнительным долгам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119543/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119543" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119543"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasann3w4/"></a>4910</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 16%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119544/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119544" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119544"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4gth31/"></a>4010, 4020</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119545/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119545" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119545"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4nmlwa/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 62%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119546/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119546" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119546"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastolk6g/"></a>Присоединение к прибыли года, следующего за годом создания резервов, неизрасходованной части суммы резервов по сомнительным долгам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119547/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119547" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119547"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaseosgxh/"></a>4910</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 16%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119548/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119548" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119548"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasyyigkd/"></a>9390</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119549/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119549" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119549"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas74zzi2/"></a><strong>Денежные средства в кассе (5000)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119550/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119550" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119550"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasu3xdsp/"></a>222. Обобщение информации о наличии и движении денежных средств в кассе организации осуществляется на следующих счетах:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119551/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119551" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119551"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszqfrnk/"></a>5010 &#34;Денежные средства в национальной валюте&#34;;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119552/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119552" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119552"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasu3buv2/"></a>5020 &#34;Денежные средства в иностранной валюте&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119553/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119553" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119553"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1o0yse/"></a>В случае необходимости в отдельных организациях (транспорта, связи) могут быть открыты такие счета, как &#34;Касса организации&#34; и &#34;Операционная касса&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119554/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119554" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119554"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2yx1f5/"></a>По дебету счетов учета денежных средств в кассе (5000) отражается поступление денежных средств в кассу организации. По кредиту отражается выплата денежных средств из кассы организации и сдача сверхлимитных денег в банк.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119555/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119555" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119555"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvad77f/"></a>223. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета денежных средств в кассе (5000) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119556/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119556" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119556"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmc25gg/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119557/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119557" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119557"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasir55nk/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119558/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119558" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119558"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbi8aea/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119559"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbrinir/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119560"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasthr32g/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119561/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119561" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119561"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6h5o95/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119562/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119562" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119562"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9xdced/"></a>Получение наличными процентов по товарам, проданным в кредит (в торговых организациях)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119563/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119563" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119563"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassfbl8o/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119564/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119564" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119564"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgew5b3/"></a>4830</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119565/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119565" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119565"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasy6m38n/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119566/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119566" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119566"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasb47no2/"></a>Реализация продукции, работ и услуг за наличные</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119567/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119567" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119567"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1lz2sm/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119568/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119568" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2p5v64/"></a>9010-9030</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrf98my/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5m3sr6/"></a>Получение наличными выручки от продажи основных средств и прочих активов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuhdebw/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9s7zxt/"></a>9210-9220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119573" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119573"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnmeovw/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119574/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119574" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119574"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszf6ywf/"></a>Поступление денежных средств в кассу с соответствующих счетов в банке (для выдачи заработной платы, пенсий, премий и т.п.)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119575/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119575" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119575"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasyud1o4/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119576/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119576" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119576"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9lrt6g/"></a>5110-5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119577/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119577" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119577"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0s9skz/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasytfpon/"></a>Возврат подотчетными лицами неиспользованных ранее полученных авансов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8m321y/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasprxzo0/"></a>4220-4290</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas63le3q/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashvd583/"></a>Эмиссионный доход, полученный в результате продажи акций по цене выше номинальной стоимости</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119583/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119583" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119583"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasklbuas/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119584/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119