e-anchor="bssPhr119642"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfass0u29c/"></a>Погашение задолженности по начисленным процентам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119643/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119643" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119643"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0gx3gv/"></a>6920</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119644/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119644" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119644"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaseh5qe5/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119645/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119645" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119645"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasv211v6/"></a>22.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119646/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119646" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119646"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasl1xdm8/"></a>Оплата причитающихся арендодателю платежей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119647/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119647" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119647"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasyf3z31/"></a>6910, 6950</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119648/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119648" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119648"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6xp0go/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119649/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119649" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119649"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw489y4/"></a><strong>Денежные средства на расчетном счете (5100)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119650/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119650" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119650"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasdr1g5m/"></a>224. Обобщение информации о наличии и движении денежных средств на расчетном счете организации в банке осуществляется на счете 5110 &#34;Расчетный счет&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119651/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119651" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119651"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasi4wwhi/"></a>225. По дебету счета 5110 &#34;Расчетный счет&#34; отражается поступление денежных средств на расчетный счет. По кредиту счета 5110 &#34;Расчетный счет&#34; отражается списание денежных средств с расчетного счета организации. Суммы, ошибочно отнесенные в дебет или кредит расчетного счета организации и выявленные при проверке выписок банка, отражаются в корреспонденции со счетом 4860 &#34;Платежи к получению по претензиям&#34; или 6960 &#34;Платежи по претензиям&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119652/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119652" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119652"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1adgtp/"></a>В бухгалтерском учете операции по расчетному счету отражаются на основании выписок банка и приложенных к ним денежных и расчетных документов.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119653/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119653" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119653"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasn6ctvv/"></a>Аналитический учет по счетам учета денежных средств на расчетном счете (5100) ведется по каждому счету, открытому в банках для хранения денежных средств в национальной валюте.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119654/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119654" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119654"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspfpz1h/"></a>226. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета денежных средств на расчетном счете (5100) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119655/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119655" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119655"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswy6cmx/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119656/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119656" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119656"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3eet5d/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119657/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119657" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119657"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskoi69l/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119658/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119658" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119658"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7z4pce/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119659/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119659" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119659"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasa4qiv4/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119660/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119660" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119660"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashpp3vk/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119661/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119661" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119661"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgclpfm/"></a>Поступление арендной платы от арендатора по основным средствам, переданным в аренду</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119662/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119662" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119662"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasdn7qdh/"></a>5110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119663/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119663" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119663"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaschrbfi/"></a>4810, 4820</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119664/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119664" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119664"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasl0fox9/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119665/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119665" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119665"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasc333x8/"></a>Поступление денежных средств от продажи товаров в кредит</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119666/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119666" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119666"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxgu1g3/"></a>5110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119667/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119667" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119667"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasay0pp7/"></a>4710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119668/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119668" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119668"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7b0m24/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119669/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119669" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119669"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8utp24/"></a>Поступление выручки от реализации продукции (товаров, работ, услуг), основных средств и прочих активов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119670/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119670" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119670"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascsqi7y/"></a>5110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119671/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119671" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119671"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxu788w/"></a>4010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119672/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119672" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119672"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspt7e48/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119673/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119673" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119673"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2l2ls6/"></a>Сдача денежных средств из кассы на расчетный счет</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119674/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119674" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119674"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasis8yw3/"></a>5110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style=