class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119681/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119681" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119681"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfbmqb1/"></a>Перечисление на расчетный счет сумм по возвращенным в банк чекам и аккредитивам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119682/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119682" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119682"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuhrvka/"></a>5110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119683/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119683" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119683"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrgbzhe/"></a>5510, 5520</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119684/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119684" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119684"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5uv15n/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119685/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119685" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119685"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastt1952/"></a>Возврат займов, ранее предоставленных в порядке краткосрочных инвестиций</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119686/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119686" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" d