"></a>Погашение задолженности по страхованию и платежам в государственные целевые фонды</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119734/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119734" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119734"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0rpc4k/"></a>6510-6520</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119735/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119735" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119735"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaso34g7b/"></a>5110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119736/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119736" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119736"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaso7ida4/"></a>20.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119737/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119737" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119737"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxevk3q/"></a>Выплата учредителям начисленных дивидендов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119738/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119738" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119738"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas76s7p8/"></a>6610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119739/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119739" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119739"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspy1t9x/"></a>5110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119740/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119740" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119740"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszicsst/"></a>21.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119741/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119741" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119741"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2fot3b/"></a>Погашение суммы задолженности обособленным подразделениям, дочерним и зависимым хозяйственным обществам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119742/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119742" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119742"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasq9aifk/"></a>6110, 6120</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119743/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119743" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119743"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasy2hmhy/"></a>5110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119744/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119744" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119744"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasssvaye/"></a>22.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119745/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119745" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119745"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg3xks3/"></a>Погашение краткосрочных кредитов и займов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119746/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119746" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119746"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6p18yv/"></a>6810-6840</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119747/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119747" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119747"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4w11fv/"></a>5110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119748/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119748" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119748"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6b9069/"></a>23.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119749/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119749" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119749"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvkllla/"></a>Погашение текущей части долгосрочных кредитов и займов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119750/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119750" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119750"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash7uqm8/"></a>6950</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119751/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119751" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119751"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasa44z61/"></a>5110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119752/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119752" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119752"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasi7hrva/"></a>24.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119753/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119753" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119753"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswmdb5o/"></a>Погашение задолженности по начисленным процентам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119754/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119754" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119754"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1p6gxs/"></a>6920</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119755/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119755" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119755"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6w2kmm/"></a>5110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119756/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119756" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119756"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasot0tg5/"></a>25.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119757/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119757" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119757"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswf6tdb/"></a>Оплата причитающихся арендодателю платежей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119758/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119758" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119758"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas21gu4q/"></a>6910, 6950</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119759/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119759" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119759"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1lsd7i/"></a>5110</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119760/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119760" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119760"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5x5n6n/"></a><strong>Денежные средства в иностранной валюте (5200)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119761/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119761" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119761"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasw0prhc/"></a>227. Обобщение информации о наличии и движении денежных средств в иностранной валюте на счетах в банках на территории Республики Узбекистан и за рубежом осуществляется на следующих счетах:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119762/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119762" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119762"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5b7gog/"></a>5210 &#34;Валютные счета внутри страны&#34;;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119763/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119763" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119763"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3xupti/"></a>5220 &#34;Валютные счета за рубежом&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119764/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119764" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119764"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascpa1g4/"></a>228. По дебету счетов 5210 &#34;Валютные счета внутри страны&#34; и 5220 &#34;Валютные счета за рубежом&#34; отражается поступление денежных средств на валютные счета, по кредиту - списание денежных средств. Суммы, ошибочно отнесенные в дебет или кредит валютного счета и выявленные при проверке выписок банка, отражаются в корреспонденции со счетами 4860 &#34;Платежи к получению по претензиям&#34; или 6960 &#34;Платежи по претензиям&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119765/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119765" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119765"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1adrsb/"></a>В бухгалтерском учете операции по валютному счету отражаются на основании выписок банка и приложенных к ним денежных и расчетных документов.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119766/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119766" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119766"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1l6ybp/"></a>Аналитический учет валютных средств ведется по каждому счету, открытому в банках для хранения денежных средств в иностранной валюте.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119767/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119767" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119767"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassch8h7/"></a>229. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета денежных средств в иностранной валюте (5200) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119768/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119768" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119768"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassh2k9o/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119769/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119769" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119769"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7d4g4z/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119770/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119770" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119770"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxq4guz/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119771/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119771" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119771"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasb0itb5/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119772/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119772" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119772"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszgn4pe/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119773/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119773" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119773"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas17d0gg/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119774/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119774" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119774"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasc8l6ix/"></a>Поступление денежных средств в иностранной валюте от арендатора за арендную плату по основным средствам, переданным в аренду</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119775/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119775" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119775"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfass2069l/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119776/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119776" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119776"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasv6nr7q/"></a>4810, 4820</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119777/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119777" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119777"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasi181pr/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119778/" data-role=