 денежных средств в иностранной валюте из банка в кассу</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119819/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119819" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119819"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0mtizm/"></a>5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119820/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119820" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119820"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqnq6pg/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119821/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119821" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119821"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasutwalk/"></a>13.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119822/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119822" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119822"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasotvrzg/"></a>Выкуп собственных акций</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119823/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119823" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119823"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasymftrq/"></a>8610, 8620</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119824/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119824" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119824"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas73ztgt/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119825/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119825" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119825"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5yr0x6/"></a>14.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119826/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119826" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119826"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgn72c5/"></a>Оплата задолженности перед поставщиками и подрядчиками</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119827/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119827" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119827"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastvma7o/"></a>6010</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119828/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119828" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119828"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash7hug6/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119829/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119829" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119829"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8pz57f/"></a>15.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119830/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119830" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119830"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvyguuq/"></a>Сумма выданных авансов в иностранной валюте</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119831/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119831" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119831"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7u7ylp/"></a>4310-4330</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119832/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119832" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119832"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxn1gpx/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119833/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119833" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119833"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas47cgey/"></a>16.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119834/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119834" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119834"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnah4x4/"></a>Возврат ранее полученных авансов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119835/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119835" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119835"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqhyyyw/"></a>6300, 7310</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119836/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119836" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119836"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasoghvxu/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119837/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119837" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119837"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaslufzg7/"></a>17.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119838/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119838" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119838"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastsvkub/"></a>Выплата учредителям начисленных дивидендов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119839/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119839" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119839"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7vwa2r/"></a>6610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119840/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119840" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119840"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbp9wa4/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119841/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119841" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119841"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5xs307/"></a>18.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119842/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119842" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119842"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxnsten/"></a>Погашение задолженности по начисленным процентам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119843/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119843" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119843"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas45pg5t/"></a>6920</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119844/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119844" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119844"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastei8cd/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119845/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119845" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119845"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4rm532/"></a>19.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119846/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119846" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119846"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszbc2ct/"></a>Погашение краткосрочных кредитов и займов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119847/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119847" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119847"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7cawi2/"></a>6810-6840</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119848/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119848" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119848"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasi40p11/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119849/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119849" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119849"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaso8g4ax/"></a>20.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119850/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119850" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119850"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2gr2mw/"></a>Погашение текущей части долгосрочных кредитов и займов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119851/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119851" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119851"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastowrmb/"></a>6950</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119852/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119852" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119852"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8q4kfo/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119853/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119853" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119853"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4aymlr/"></a>21.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119854/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119854" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119854"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskecxz3/"></a>Оплата причитающихся арендодателю платежей в иностранной валюте</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119855/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119855" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119855"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas77evfe/"></a>6910, 6950</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119856/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119856" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119856"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasa48s1r/"></a>5210, 5220</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119857/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119857" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119857"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswc47yz/"></a><strong>Денежные средства на специальных счетах&#160;<a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascepa60/"></a>в банках (5500)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119858/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119858" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119858"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasdf9kdo/"></a>230. Обобщение информации о наличии и движении денежных средств на территории Республики Узбекистан и за рубежом в аккредитивах, чековых книжках, других платежных документах (кроме векселей), а также о движении денежных средств целевого финансирования (поступлений) в той их части, которая подлежит обособленному хранению, осуществляется на следующих счетах:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119859/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119859" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119859"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas93oeii/"></a>5510 &#34;Аккредитивы&#34;;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119860/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119860" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119860"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1bf5ti/"></a>5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34;;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119861/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119861" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119861"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasic6gf8/"></a>5530 &#34;Прочие специальные счета&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119862/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119862" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119862"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasv8bgyv/"></a>231. На счете 5510 &#34;Аккредитивы&#34; учитываются денежные средства в аккредитивах. Зачисление денежных средств в аккредитивы отражается по дебету счета 5510 &#34;Аккредитивы&#34; и кредиту счетов 5110 &#34;Расчетный счет&#34;, 5210 &#34;Валютные счета внутри страны&#34;, 5220 &#34;Валютные счета за рубежом&#34; и других счетов.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119863/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119863" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119863"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasy85zc0/"></a>По кредиту счета 5510 &#34;Аккредитивы&#34; списываются денежные средства, принятые на учет в аккредитив, по мере их использования (согласно выпискам банка) в дебет счета 6010 &#34;Платежи поставщикам и подрядчикам&#34;. Неиспользованные средства в аккредитивах после восстановления банком на те счета, с которых они были перечислены, отражаются по кредиту счета 5510 &#34;Аккредитивы&#34; в корреспонденции со счетами 5110 &#34;Расчетный счет&#34;, 5210 &#34;Валютные счета внутри страны&#34;, 5220 &#34;Валютные счета за рубежом&#34; и другими счетами.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119864/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119864" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119864"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnfredq/"></a>Аналитический учет по счету 5510 &#34;Аккредитивы&#34; ведется по каждому аккредитиву отдельно.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119865/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119865" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119865"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasroavo0/"></a>232. На счете 5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34; учитывается движение денежных средств в чековых книжках. Депонирование денежных средств при выдаче чековых книжек отражается по дебету счета 5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34; и кредиту счетов 5110 &#34;Расчетный счет&#34;, 5210 &#34;Валютные счета внутри страны&#34;, 5220 &#34;Валютные счета за рубежом&#34;, 6810 &#34;Краткосрочные кредиты&#34; и других счетов. По мере оплаты выданных чеков сумма списывается с кредита счета 5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34; в корреспонденции со счетами учета затрат и задолженности. Сумма, выданная по чекам, но не оплаченная банком (не предъявленная к оплате), остается на счете 5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34;, и остаток по счету 5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34; должен соответствовать выпискам банка. Сумма возвращенных в банк чеков (оставшиеся неиспользованными) отражается по кредиту счета 5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34; в корреспонденции со счетами 5110 &#34;Расчетный счет&#34;, 5210 &#34;Валютные счета внутри страны&#34;, 5220 &#34;Валютные счета за рубежом&#34; и другими счетами.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119866/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119866" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119866"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash2hszv/"></a>Контроль за движением средств на чековых книжках, выданных подотчетным работникам организации для расчетов с кредиторами, ведется оперативно.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119867/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119867" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119867"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastgekcn/"></a>Аналитический учет по счету 5520 &#34;Чековые книжки&#34; ведется по каждой полученной чековой книжке.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119868/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119868" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119868"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqtvzcl/"></a>233. На счете 5530 &#34;Прочие специальные счета&#34; учитывается движение обособленно хранящихся в банке средств целевого финансирования (поступлений), в том числе денежных средств, поступивших на содержание социальных учреждений, объектов (детские сады и др.) от родителей, иных пользователей и из прочих источников, средств для финансирования капитальных вложений, аккумулируемых и расходуемых по просьбе организации с отдельного счета, субсидии государственных ведомств и т.д.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119869/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119869" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119869"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas15r0oc/"></a>На отдельном счете отражается движение указанных средств на текущих счетах, открытых в банке обособленным подразделениям для осуществления текущих расходов (заработная плата, отдельные хозяйственные расходы, служебные командировки и т.д.).</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119870/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119870" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119870"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasay9s17/"></a>Аналитический учет по счету 5530 &#34;Прочие специальные счета&#34; должен обеспечить возможность получения данных о наличии и движении денежных средств на прочих специальных счетах как на территории Республики Узбекистан, так и за рубежом.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119871/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119871" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119871"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3ggus2/"></a>234. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета денежных средств на специальных счетах в банке (5500) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119872/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119872" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119872"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1i9qyf/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119873/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119873" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119873"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasy7tvys/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119874/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119874" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119874"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuz7czl/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119875/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119875" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119875"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6ferg7/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119876/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119876" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119876"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuxfl4w/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119877/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119877" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119877"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfi7uon/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119878/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119878" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119878"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascmnym0/"></a>Зачисление денежных средств в аккредитивы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119879/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119879" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119879"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfxp8un/"></a>5510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119880/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119880" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119880"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgk7g4c/"></a>5110-5220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119881/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119881" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119881"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfask1vufx/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119882/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119882" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119882"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas38a0fg/"></a>Поступление на специальный счет сумм удовлетворенных претензий</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119883/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119883" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119883"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasggidvt/"></a>5510-5530</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119884/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119884" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119884"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbkxcip/"></a>4860</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119885/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119885" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119885"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8ddogb/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119886/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119886" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119886"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2md4dg/"></a>Получение суммы аванса от подписчиков на акции в виде депозита участника</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119887/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119887" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119887"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasu3awo4/"></a>5530</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119888/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119888" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119888"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqccgs0/"></a>6320</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119889/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119889" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119889"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspnzf7e/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119890/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119890" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119890"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1dnx84/"></a>Зачисление денежных средств в аккредитивы за счет краткосрочных кредитов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119891/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119891" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119891"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasiq0ykg/"></a>5510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119892/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119892" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119892"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqnw9qx/"></a>6810</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119893/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119893" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119893"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas81h6tg/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119894/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119894" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119894"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskn41qv/"></a>Осуществление оплаты чеками расходов по реализации</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119895/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119895" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119895"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxvwwv9/"></a>9410</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119896/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119896" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119896"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascpqkq1/"></a>5520</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119897/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119897" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119897"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg7tq23/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119898/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119898" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119898"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasf9039w/"></a>Возврат в конце срока неиспользованной суммы:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119899/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119899" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119899"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmdmkpc/"></a>а) аккредитивов;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119900/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119900" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119900"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassg4gn7/"></a>б) чековых книжек</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119901/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119901" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119901"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasn35lgp/"></a>5110-5220</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119902/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119902" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119902"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2kf0yq/"></a>5110-5220</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119903/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119903" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119903"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxczdwu/"></a>5510</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119904/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119904" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119904"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1vrgvy/"></a>5520</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119905/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119905" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119905"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0hn73i/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119906/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119906" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119906"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashi53qi/"></a>Списание суммы аккредитива при оплате задолженности поставщикам и подрядчикам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119907/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119907" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119907"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfde1w8/"></a>6010</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119908/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119908" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119908"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszoeuas/"></a>5510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119909/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119909" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119909"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasa2ae9g/"></a>8.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119910/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119910" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119910"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqg3h74/"></a>Выдача аванса с аккредитива</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119911/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119911" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119911"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasr46mkm/"></a>4310-4330</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119912/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119912" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119912"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas91bmta/"></a>5510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119913/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119913" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119913"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8rtmsa/"></a>9.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119914/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119914" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119914"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasztr7nf/"></a>Погашение задолженности по страхованию за счет средств аккредитива</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119915/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119915" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119915"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasqktkov/"></a>6510</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119916/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119916" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119916"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasod5q9y/"></a>5510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119917/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119917" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119917"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaso23fdc/"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119918/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119918" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119918"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswyix4k/"></a>Списание суммы использованных чеков по мере оплаты услуг прочих кредиторов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119919/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119919" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119919"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspbo06o/"></a>6990</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119920/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119920" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119920"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszb70ku/"></a>5520</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119921/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119921" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119921"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx8g6k1/"></a>11.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119922/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119922" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119922"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaschcbuw/"></a>Оплата со специального счета задолженности дочерним и зависимым хозяйственным обществам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119923/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119923" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119923"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasag6tfg/"></a>6120</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119924/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119924" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119924"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas91edqh/"></a>5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119925/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119925" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119925"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1hg4q1/"></a>12.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119926/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119926" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119926"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasm3wubf/"></a>Сумма, оплаченная со специального счета за приобретенные путевки</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119927/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119927" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119927"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2q1ue6/"></a>5610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119928/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119928" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119928"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasouz3h7/"></a>5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119929/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119929" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119929"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas7dlqdm/"></a>13.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119930/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119930" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119930"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas40xg0f/"></a>Возврат неиспользованных средств чековых книжек для погашения краткосрочных кредитов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119931/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119931" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119931"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasn0v4b3/"></a>6810</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119932/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119932" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119932"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9ig1o0/"></a>5520</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119933/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119933" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119933"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszibo7x/"></a>14.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119934/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119934" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119934"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswnvyhq/"></a>Возврат неиспользованных средств аккредитива для погашения долгосрочных кредитов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119935/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119935" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119935"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5qb5xx/"></a>6950, 7810</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119936/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119936" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119936"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfassqq4qg/"></a>5510</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119937/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119937" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119937"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg6lwty/"></a>15.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119938/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119938" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119938"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspu0394/"></a>Погашение задолженности по начисленным процентам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119939/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119939" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119939"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskckfog/"></a>6920</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119940/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119940" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119940"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas05huz2/"></a>5510-5530</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119941/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119941" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119941"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaswg9crh/"></a>16.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119942/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119942" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119942"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4o6bom/"></a>Оплата причитающихся арендодателю платежей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119943/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119943" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119943"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspkbftt/"></a>6910, 6950</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119944/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119944" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119944"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9g679g/"></a>5530</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119945/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119945" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119945"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskgqkys/"></a><strong>Денежные эквиваленты (5600)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119946/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119946" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119946"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasiyym1f/"></a>235. Обобщение информации о наличии и движении денежных эквивалентов (почтовых марок и др.), находящихся в кассе организации осуществляется на счете 5610 &#34;Денежные эквиваленты (по видам)&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119947/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119947" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119947"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfass5cx8w/"></a>На счете 5610 &#34;Денежные эквиваленты (по видам)&#34; учитываются марки, билеты и прочие денежные эквиваленты по номинальной стоимости. По дебету счета учета денежных эквивалентов отражается приобретение денежных эквивалентов в корреспонденции со счетами учета денежных средств, а по кредиту - расходование денежных эквивалентов в корреспонденции со счетами учета затрат.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119948/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119948" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119948"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasii08fe/"></a>Аналитический учет по счетам учета денежных эквивалентов (5600) ведется по их видам.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119949/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119949" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119949"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3clrca/"></a>236. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета денежных эквивалентов (5600) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119950/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119950" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119950"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfast4qt5m/"></a><strong>№</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119951/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119951" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119951"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxwwenz/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119952/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119952" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119952"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastil37s/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119953/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119953" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119953"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas07mddi/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119954/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119954" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119954"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxbptes/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119955/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119955" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119955"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4kxncg/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119956/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119956" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119956"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskw3kw2/"></a>Приобретение денежных эквивалентов за наличный расчет</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119957/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119957" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119957"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2eggtk/"></a>5610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119958/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119958" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119958"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxkuagn/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119959/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119959" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119959"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9nipe7/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119960/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119960" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119960"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasno0m2d/"></a>Приобретение денежных эквивалентов путем перечисления денежных средств с расчетного счета</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119961/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119961" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119961"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasp1dgmm/"></a>5610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119962/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119962" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119962"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1so7ob/"></a>5110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119963/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119963" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119963"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2k3d7f/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119964/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119964" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119964"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgbn7ib/"></a>Приобретение денежных эквивалентов через подотчетных лиц</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119965/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119965" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119965"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfascqhn5b/"></a>5610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119966/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119966" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119966"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasrv0v5v/"></a>4220-4290 6970</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119967/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119967" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119967"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaskta8vm/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119968/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119968" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119968"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasle8xku/"></a>Приобретение денежных эквивалентов от различных лиц</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119969/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119969" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119969"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3cqc0r/"></a>5610</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119970/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119970" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119970"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas83cq7o/"></a>6990</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119971/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119971" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119971"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasiht4pa/"></a><strong>Денежные средства (переводы) в пути (5700)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119972/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119972" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119972"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas9hdmdh/"></a>237. Обобщение информации о денежных средствах, находящихся в пути (доход от реализации продукции за наличный расчет и посредством денежных переводов) осуществляется на счете 5710 &#34;Денежные средства (переводы) в пути&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119973/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119973" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119973"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasmw8rqe/"></a>238. На счете 5710 &#34;Денежные средства (переводы) в пути&#34; учитываются денежные средства, выбывшие из места хранения, но еще не поступившие по месту назначения (выручка от реализации, сданная инкассаторам, денежные переводы).</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119974/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119974" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119974"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasyfgghw/"></a>Данный счет является транзитным и выполняет функцию связывающего звена для установления непрерывного контроля за движением денежных средств.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119975/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119975" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119975"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasc27x3m/"></a>По дебету счета 5710 &#34;Денежные средства (переводы) в пути&#34; отражается сдача денежных средств инкассаторам в корреспонденции со счетами учета денежных средств в кассе. После оприходования денежных средств счет 5710 &#34;Денежные средства (переводы) в пути&#34; кредитуется в корреспонденции со счетами учета денежных средств.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119976/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119976" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119976"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas3tk46o/"></a>Аналитический учет по счетам учета денежных средств (переводов) в пути (5700) ведется по их видам.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119977/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119977" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119977"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx6a6ad/"></a>239. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета денежных средств (переводов) в пути (5700) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119978/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119978" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119978"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasb8ptyb/"></a><strong>№</strong></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119979/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119979" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119979"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszsy21y/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119980/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119980" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119980"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastturzv/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119981/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119981" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119981"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas47t7cs/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119982/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119982" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119982"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuibw81/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119983/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119983" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119983"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasvromf7/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119984/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119984" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119984"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasyvtkrb/"></a>Передача наличных денег из кассы инкассатору для зачисления на счет в банке</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119985/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119985" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119985"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashebcnq/"></a>5710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119986/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119986" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119986"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas4rkbek/"></a>5010, 5020</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119987/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119987" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119987"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgl3xls/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119988/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119988" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119988"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaschw42f/"></a>Погашение задолженности покупателей по поступившим денежным переводам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119989/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119989" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119989"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1c8kfk/"></a>5710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119990/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119990" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119990"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasv4hub5/"></a>4010</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119991/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119991" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119991"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas0lhy75/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119992/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119992" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119992"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastv1vnl/"></a>Получение аванса путем перечисления денежных средств, еще не поступивших в банк</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119993/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119993" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119993"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaspgso57/"></a>5710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119994/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119994" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119994"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas6xt2vc/"></a>6300, 7310</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119995/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119995" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119995"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasleelnq/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119996/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119996" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119996"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas50ufcg/"></a>Получение денежных переводов от прочих дебиторов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119997/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119997" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119997"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasbed8qg/"></a>5710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119998/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119998" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119998"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasggyhks/"></a>4890</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr119999/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="119999" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr119999"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas60yuei/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120000/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120000" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120000"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas2xzy26/"></a>Получение денежных переводов от обособленных подразделений</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120001/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120001" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120001"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas8eyof3/"></a>5710</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120002/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120002" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120002"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash1e9xc/"></a>4110</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120003/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120003" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120003"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasofk6pw/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120004/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120004" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120004"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5iibfv/"></a>Поступление денежных средств в пути в кассу</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120005/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120005" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120005"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasalilgk/"></a>5010-5020</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120006/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120006" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120006"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasyot2gs/"></a>5710</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120007/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120007" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120007"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasgwmlro/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120008/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120008" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120008"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasb2g75v/"></a>Поступление денежных средств в пути на счет в банке</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120009/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120009" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120009"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasugr5kf/"></a>5110</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120010/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120010" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120010"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasb1mtf1/"></a>5710</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120011/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120011" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120011"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxz2ovz/"></a><strong>Краткосрочные инвестиции (5800)</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120012/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120012" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120012"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1fguno/"></a>240. Обобщение информации о наличии и движении краткосрочных (на срок не более одного года) инвестиций организации в ценные бумаги других организаций, процентные облигации государственных займов, займы, предоставленные другим организациям, и т.п. осуществляется на следующих счетах:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120013/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120013" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120013"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas715hoy/"></a>5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34;;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120014/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120014" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120014"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasq4x7ol/"></a>5830 &#34;Краткосрочные займы выданные&#34;;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120015/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120015" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120015"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastqgpzv/"></a>5890 &#34;Прочие текущие инвестиции&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120016/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120016" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120016"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas5scxnu/"></a>241. На счете 5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34; учитывается наличие и движение краткосрочных инвестиций в акции, процентные облигации государственных займов и другие ценные бумаги.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120017/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120017" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120017"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfbavge/"></a>Облигации и другие ценные бумаги приходуются на счет 5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34; по покупной стоимости.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120018/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120018" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120018"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasezg3pe/"></a>Приобретение организацией акций, облигаций и других ценных бумаг отражается по дебету счета 5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34; и кредиту счетов учета денежных средств, а также счетов учета реализации материальных и иных ценностей, если оплата ценных бумаг производится путем предоставления материальных или иных ценностей (кроме денежных средств).</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120019/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120019" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120019"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas86l55u/"></a>Если покупная стоимость приобретенных облигаций и иных долговых ценных бумаг отличается от их номинальной стоимости, то при списании или доначислении этой разницы стоимость ценных бумаг, учтенных на счете 5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34;, должна соответствовать номинальной стоимости в период их погашения. Разница между покупной и номинальной стоимостью отражается за период до погашения по дебету (доначисление) или кредиту (списание) счета 5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34; в корреспонденции со счетами 9590 &#34;Прочие доходы от финансовой деятельности&#34; или 9690 &#34;Прочие расходы по финансовой деятельности&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120020/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120020" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120020"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfash86l11/"></a>Погашение облигаций и других ценных бумаг, учитываемых на счете 5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34;, отражается по дебету счета учета денежных средств и кредиту счета 5810 &#34;Ценные бумаги&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120021/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120021" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120021"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasik77td/"></a>242. На счете 5830 &#34;Краткосрочные займы выданные&#34; учитывается движение краткосрочных займов, предоставленных организацией другим организациям в денежной и других формах.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120022/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120022" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120022"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasimod3g/"></a>Предоставленные займы отражаются по дебету счета 5830 &#34;Краткосрочные займы выданные&#34; в корреспонденции со счетами учета денежных средств. Возврат займов отражается по дебету счетов учета денежных средств и кредиту счета 5830 &#34;Краткосрочные займы выданные&#34;.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120023/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120023" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120023"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfastbanfk/"></a>243. На счете 5890 &#34;Прочие текущие инвестиции&#34; учитывается движение инвестиций в сумах и иностранной валюте в банковские и другие вклады.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120024/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120024" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120024"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasiiisyw/"></a>Перечисление денежных средств во вклады отражается по дебету счета 5890 &#34;Прочие текущие инвестиции&#34; в корреспонденции со счетами учета денежных средств. При возврате банком суммы вкладов в учете производятся обратные записи.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120025/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120025" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120025"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashs519s/"></a>Аналитический учет по счетам учета краткосрочных инвестиций (5800) ведется по видам краткосрочных инвестиций и объектам, в которые осуществлены эти инвестиции.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120026/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120026" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120026"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaszv1icz/"></a>244. Примеры корреспонденции счетов учета краткосрочных инвестиций (5800) с другими счетами:</p><div style="text-align:center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120027/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120027" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120027"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1er07b/"></a><strong>№</strong></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120028/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120028" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120028"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasq8oz4b/"></a>Содержание хозяйственных операций</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120029/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120029" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120029"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnbc53f/"></a>Корреспонденция счетов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120030/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120030" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120030"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfashbns1g/"></a>Дебет</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120031/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120031" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120031"></a><strong><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas1ph6pi/"></a>Кредит</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120032/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120032" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120032"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasnxmy0u/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120033/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120033" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120033"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfaseilbby/"></a>Приобретение ценных бумаг путем предоставления продукции, товаров, работ, услуг</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120034/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120034" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120034"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas748d91/"></a>5810</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120035/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120035" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120035"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasuo6cu2/"></a>9010-9030</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120036/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120036" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120036"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxgp8op/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120037/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120037" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120037"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasfd1zsf/"></a>Приобретение ценных бумаг путем предоставления основных средств и прочих активов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120038/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120038" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120038"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasziglam/"></a>5810</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120039/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120039" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120039"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasxkl9k1/"></a>9210, 9220</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120040/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120040" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120040"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasszrgd8/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr120041/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="120041" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr120041"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasy57zw5/"></a>Осуществление реструктуризации долгосрочных инвестиций</p></td><td class="bdBott