ata-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasedn7it/"></a>9210 (на остаточную стоимость)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr116295/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="116295" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr116295"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasx0fl8y/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 64%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr116296/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="116296" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr116296"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasv3ogu0/"></a>Оприходование объекта основных средств, обмененного путем получения денежных средств или их эквивалентов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr116297/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="116297" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr116297"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfast8qa08/"></a>0100</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr116298/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="116298" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr116298"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfas15g5ub/"></a>4890</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr116299/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="116299" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr116299"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/dfasg3x4dt/"></a>9210 (на остаточную стоимость)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/15200/bssPhr116300/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="116300" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_an